title: "The Seen World Beyond The Stargate"
abstract: "A walk up the central visual pathway — optic nerve and chiasm, LGN, V1, and the dorsal and ventral streams — used as the scaffold for an ascent from vision to seeing to the authored world and, finally, the seer, closing at the hard problem of consciousness."
